      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "There was a time I thought",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "That you did everything right",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "No lies, no wrong",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Boy, I must've been out of my mind",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_2",
      "type": "pre-chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "So when I think of the time that I almost loved you",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "You showed your ass and I, I saw the real you",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Thank God you blew it, I thank God I dodged the bullet, uh",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "I'm so over you, so baby, good lookin' out",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_3",
      "type": "chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "I wanted you bad, I'm so through with that",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "'Cause honestly, you turned out to be the best thing I never had",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "You turned out to be the best thing I never had",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "And I'm gon' always be the best thing you never had",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Oh, yeah, I bet it sucks to be you right now",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
